n class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getFile</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To get the path of the audio file that needs to be transferred to the megaphone.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"imegaphonemanager_fileinfo_setdata_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setdata to set the tts binary data that needs to be transmitted to the megaphone.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setData</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To set the TTS binary data that needs to be transmitted to the megaphone.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"imegaphonemanager_fileinfo_getdata_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getdata to get the tts binary data that needs to be transmitted to the megaphone.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getData</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">To get the TTS binary data that needs to be transmitted to the megaphone.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"imegaphonemanager_fileinfo_setuploadtype\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#imegaphonemanager_fileinfo_setuploadtype_inline\">setUploadType</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"imegaphonemanager_fileinfo_setuploadtype_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setUploadType</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" da